  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "The \" Best Practices in Digitization \" issued by ETH-Bibliothek's DigiCenter offers practical tips and well-founded recommendations. The handbook covers the entire process from planning and realizing a digitization project to storage aspects and handling metadata.\n\nThe DigiCenter boasts longstanding expertise and a professional technical infrastructure. It has processed complex projects , digitized different document types and produced several millions of scans in recent years."
    }
